lse\" \n      aria-controls=\"faq4\"\n      id=\"faq4-button\"\n    >UI/UX</button>\n  </h3>\n  <div class=\"faq-content\" id=\"faq4\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq4-button\">\n    <p>\n      Tworzymy interfejsy przyjazne użytkownikom, zgodne z najnowszymi trendami UI/UX.\n    </p>\n    <ul class=\"faq-list\">\n      <li>Prototypy i makiety</li>\n      <li>Testy użyteczności</li>\n      <li>Design systemy</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- FAQ ITEM 5 -->\n<div class=\"faq-item\">\n  <h3>\n    <button class=\"faq-heading\"\n      aria-expanded=\"false\" \n      aria-controls=\"faq5\"\n      id=\"faq5-button\"\n    >Automatyzacje</button>\n  </h3>\n  <div class=\"faq-content\" id=\"faq5\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq5-button\">\n    <p>\n      Wdrażamy automatyzacje procesów biznesowych i marketingowych.\n    </p>\n    <ul class=\"faq-list\">\n      <li>Automatyczne powiadomienia</li>\n      <li>Integracje z CRM</li>\n      <li>Procesy back-office</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Strona Główna','','inherit','closed','closed','','54-revision-v1','','','2025-09-26 09:23:55','2025-09-26 07:23:55','',54,'http://localhost/bedrock/web/?p=270',0,'revision','',0),(271,1,'2025-09-26 09:26:55','2025-09-26 07:26:55','{\"src\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/bedrock\\/web\\/app\\/uploads\\/fonts\\/UcCO3FwrK3iLTeHuS_nVMrMxCp50SjIw2boKoduKmMEVuI6fMZ1rib2Bg-4.woff2\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontFamily\":\"Inter\",\"preview\":\"https:\\/\\/s.w.org\\/images\\/fonts\\/wp-6.7\\/previews\\/inter\\/inter-500-normal.svg\"}','inter;normal;500;100%;U+0-10FFFF','','publish','closed','closed','','internormal500100u0-10ffff','','','2025-09-26 09:26:55','2025-09-26 07:26:55','',88,'http://localhost/bedrock/web/internormal500100u0-10ffff/',0,'wp_font_face','',0),(300,1,'2025-10-11 09:24:25','2025-10-11 07:24:25','{\"styles\":{\"typography\":{\"fontFamily\":\"var(--wp--preset--f